  "question": {
    "text": "An electric appliance supplies <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6000</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>min</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>, heat to the system. If the system delivers a power of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>90</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math>. How long it would take to increase the internal energy by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math>?"
  },
